{"id":"644778","name":"白菜烩馍","author":"胖小西西","authorId":"11927396","desc":"","cover":"images/644778/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"馒头","amount":"2个"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"半颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"小香葱","amount":"2颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/644778/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白菜切滚刀块。","img":"images/644778/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"馒头不要切，用手掰成块。","img":"images/644778/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香葱切丁。","img":"images/644778/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切好的香葱一半加香油拌好。","img":"images/644778/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧油，下另一半葱花爆香。","img":"images/644778/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入白菜翻炒。","img":"images/644778/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加盐、鸡精、生抽、老抽继续翻炒。","img":"images/644778/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加水，根据白菜的出水量，出水少了就稍微多加点，大概小半碗足够。","img":"images/644778/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入掰好的馍丁。","img":"images/644778/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上盖子焖2分钟，把馒头焖热、焖软。","img":"images/644778/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"掀开盖子，倒入拌好的香葱。","img":"images/644778/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"拌匀即可完成！","img":"images/644778/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}